  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Test 1: getPartitions excludes all-1s partition\n\nFor n=4, should return {{4}, {3,1}, {2,2}, {2,1,1}} (not {1,1,1,1})",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test1 = Private`getPartitions[4];\nexpected1 = {{4}, {3, 1}, {2, 2}, {2, 1, 1}};\ntest1Result = Sort[test1] === Sort[expected1];\nPrint[\"Test 1 (getPartitions[4]): \", If[test1Result, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\ntest1Result",
